    "A first restart can take 10 minutes. If the setup Wi-Fi is still visible, retry its Wi-Fi details. If it has gone, the Spark is probably on the network but hidden: some routers keep devices from seeing each other, and some networks do not carry the discovery messages this search relies on. Type the Spark’s name or IP address below to reach it directly, or connect it to this network with an Ethernet cable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A first restart can take 10 minutes. If the setup Wi-Fi is still visible, retry its Wi-Fi details. If it has gone, the Spark is probably on the network but hidden: some routers keep devices from seeing each other, and some networks do not carry the discovery messages this search relies on. Type the Spark’s name or IP address below to reach it directly, or connect it to this network with an Ethernet cable."
          }
        }
      }
