    "Some numbers here are counted and some are worked out. Engine totals are exact but start again when the engine restarts. SparkPilot's daily usage is exact for the requests it handled that finished and reported usage while diagnostics were on, so it is a floor rather than a total. Rates, latencies and one-minute history points are estimates. Anything this Spark does not report is shown as unavailable, never as zero.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some numbers here are counted and some are worked out. Engine totals are exact but start again when the engine restarts. SparkPilot's daily usage is exact for the requests it handled that finished and reported usage while diagnostics were on, so it is a floor rather than a total. Rates, latencies and one-minute history points are estimates. Anything this Spark does not report is shown as unavailable, never as zero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
